Package: dgtf
Type: Package
Title: Variational and Monte Carlo Inference for Bayesian State-Space
        Models of Count Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Meini", family = "Tang", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mtang41@ucsc.edu",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5338-8772")),
    person(given = "Raquel", family = "Prado", role = "aut",
           email = "rprado@ucsc.edu",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6709-7191"))
    )
Description: Bayesian inference for a general class of state-space models
    for count data, providing a unified interface to variational Bayes and
    Markov chain Monte Carlo. Models are assembled from modular components
    for the observation distribution, link function, gain function, lag
    distribution, system equation, and system error, and support Poisson
    and negative binomial observations together with seasonal and
    regression terms.
